---
// RightSidebar.astro - Standard Right Sidebar for site-wide pages matching Image 2 template
---

<aside class="w-full lg:w-[260px] xl:w-[280px] shrink-0 space-y-6 sticky top-20">
  
  <!-- 1. 侧栏广告展示位 AD -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/60 via-white to-amber-50/40 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-2xl p-5 relative overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase bg-amber-500/90 text-white rounded shadow-2xs">广告 / AD</span>
      <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-700/80 font-medium">右侧侧栏 01</span>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center py-4 space-y-2">
      <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-amber-100/80 text-amber-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-sm font-mono font-bold shadow-2xs">
        AD
      </div>
      <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">右侧侧栏广告展示位</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">支持官网推荐 / VPS / 客户端工具推广</p>
      <div class="pt-1">
        <a href="http://liangxinyun.club/" target="_blank" class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors shadow-2xs" style="color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none !important;">
          <span style="color: #ffffff !important;">商务合作 / 投放广告</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. 常用客户端高速下载 -->
  <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/70 p-5 shadow-xs">
    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
      常用客户端高速下载
    </h4>
    <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-medium">
      <a href="/downloads/" class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white rounded-xl transition-colors text-slate-700 border border-slate-100/60 group">
        <span class="font-medium flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 group-hover:bg-white"></span>Clash for Windows</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80">下载 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/downloads/" class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white rounded-xl transition-colors text-slate-700 border border-slate-100/60 group">
        <span class="font-medium flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 group-hover:bg-white"></span>Clash Party (最新)</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80">下载 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/downloads/" class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white rounded-xl transition-colors text-slate-700 border border-slate-100/60 group">
        <span class="font-medium flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 group-hover:bg-white"></span>Sing-box 全平台</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80">下载 →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. 检测日志与动态 (REALTIME) -->
  <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/70 p-5 shadow-xs">
    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 animate-pulse" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
        检测日志与动态
      </span>
      <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-mono font-bold bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
        REALTIME
      </span>
    </h4>
    <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs transition-all overflow-hidden">
      <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-100/60 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mb-1 font-mono">
          <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">[PROBE-01]</span>
          <span>刚刚</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium"><strong class="text-slate-800">EdgeNova</strong> 港府 IPLC 专线扩容 10G 光纤出口完成</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-100/60 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mb-1 font-mono">
          <span class="text-indigo-600 font-bold">[PROBE-02]</span>
          <span>3分钟前</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium"><strong class="text-slate-800">速界</strong> BGP 游戏节点网络波动自动容灾已修复</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-100/60 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-400 mb-1 font-mono">
          <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">[PROBE-03]</span>
          <span>7分钟前</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium"><strong class="text-slate-800">可信云</strong> 隐匿高匿中转节点全线升级 TLS 1.3</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</aside>
